itle><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/david-loy-on-zen-ecodharma-ai-and-story</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/david-loy-on-zen-ecodharma-ai-and-story.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 15:20:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/david-loy-on-zen-ecodharma-ai-and-story</guid></item><item><title>重新编程生活：衰老、性别与身份</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/reprogramming-life-aging-gender-identity</link><description>生物学不是命运。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/reprogramming-life-aging-gender-identity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 15:05:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/reprogramming-life-aging-gender-identity</guid></item><item><title>难以捉摸的“中微子”正在绘制地球内部不稳定的新地图</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/elusive-geoneutrinos-are-building-a-new-map-of-earths-volatile-interior</link><description>科学家们正在世界各地使用超灵敏的地下粒子探测器来追踪地球中微子——由铀和钍等元素的放射性衰变在地球深处产生的亚原子粒子。通过探测这些“幽灵”粒子，研究人员开始绘制并了解驱动地球板块构造、地幔对流和磁场的放射性热机。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/elusive-geoneutrinos-are-building-a-new-map-of-earths-volatile-interior.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 14:50:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/elusive-geoneutrinos-are-building-a-new-map-of-earths-volatile-interior</guid></item><item><title>SKA 可能探测遥远系外行星上的磁场</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ska-may-detect-magnetic-fields-on-distant-exoplanets</link><description>研究系外行星让天文学家深入了解了可以帮助他们寻找地球以外生命的特征。多年来，天文学家认为系外行星位于恒星宜居带的位置足以使其成为一个类似地球的世界。但有些恒星比我们的太阳更活跃，使位于其宜居带的行星受到的辐射远多于地球接收到的辐射。天文学家越来越认识到，行星的磁场可以保护地球免受有害辐射，这可能是识别类地世界的关键特征。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ska-may-detect-magnetic-fields-on-distant-exoplanets2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 14:35:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ska-may-detect-magnetic-fields-on-distant-exoplanets</guid></item><item><title>实验药物可逆转多发性硬化症模型中的瘫痪和视力丧失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/experimental-drug-reverses-paralysis-and-vision-loss-in-multiple-sclerosis-model</link><description>UVA Health 科学家开发的一种药物不仅阻止而且逆转了多发性硬化症小鼠模型的瘫痪和视力丧失。结果令人震惊，因为现有的多发性硬化症治疗旨在减少未来的炎症发作，而不是恢复已经丧失的神经功能。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/experimental-drug-reverses-paralysis-and-vision-loss-in-multiple-sclerosis-model.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 14:20:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/experimental-drug-reverses-paralysis-and-vision-loss-in-multiple-sclerosis-model</guid></item><item><title>衰老可以像疾病一样治疗吗？科学家们开始发现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/can-aging-be-treated-like-a-disease-scientists-are-starting-to-find-out</link><description>随着长寿研究的进展，科学家们正在寻找新的方法来检验一个曾经推测的想法：衰老本身可能成为医学的一个目标。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/can-aging-be-treated-like-a-disease-scientists-are-starting-to-find-out.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 14:05:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/can-aging-be-treated-like-a-disease-scientists-are-starting-to-find-out</guid></item><item><title>这种危险的真菌已经对我们拥有的所有主要抗真菌药物产生了抗药性......两次</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/this-dangerous-fungus-has-become-resistant-to-every-major-antifungal-drug-we-have-twice</link><description>我们中间出现了一种新真菌，它引起了医疗保健专家的警惕，因为它对所有主要的抗真菌治疗都有抵抗力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/this-dangerous-fungus-has-become-resistant-to-every-major-antifungal-drug-we-have-twice.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 13:50:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/this-dangerous-fungus-has-become-resistant-to-every-major-antifungal-drug-we-have-twice</guid></item></channel></rss>